	(text "Full LiPo: 4.2V\nEmpty LiPo: 2.5V\nADC resolution: 12 bits\nVoltage resolution: 3.3V / 2^12 = 0.8 mV\nBAT_LVL at full: 2.1V\nBAT_LVL at empty: 1.25V\nStates between full and empty: (2.1V - 1.25V) / 0.8mV = ~1060 states"
